9
00:00:38,149 --> 00:00:43,149
And we are approaching this on a three pillar strategy.

10
00:00:43,149 --> 00:00:51,149
The first one is about how do we fit the requirement of the AI talent to the business that we are looking at?

11
00:00:51,149 --> 00:00:55,149
We have AI first business, we have AI augmented business.

12
00:00:55,149 --> 00:00:59,149
So we need to augment everyone in the organization with AI skills.

13
00:00:59,149 --> 00:01:00,149
That's on one side.

14
00:01:00,149 --> 00:01:06,969
On the other side, for the AI-first business, we need a deep engineering and domain expertise.

15
00:01:07,549 --> 00:01:10,810
