16
00:01:11,409 --> 00:01:13,549
So there are two tracks running in parallel.

17
00:01:13,709 --> 00:01:18,790
There is AI-augmented talent, then there is a deep engineering and domain expertise,

18
00:01:19,310 --> 00:01:22,129
