21
00:01:39,150 --> 00:01:43,150
So we call it as a Y-shaped career architecture.

22
00:01:43,150 --> 00:01:55,150
So that is the second part. And the third and the most involved and probably the most complex process is to enable the entire organization to be AI first.

23
00:01:55,150 --> 00:02:02,409
So it is a three-pillar strategy for us to do the entire talent transformation for the era of AI.

